    amlo:mitigation amx:M0004 ;
    amlo:technique amx:T0029 .

<https://example.org/amltrix/link/09513649-e585-4d9c-8a04-8778afe6457e> a amlo:DataSourceLink ;
    dct:description """- Identifies high-risk or weakly regulated jurisdictions where gambling operations may be exploited for money laundering.
