    amlo:technique amx:T0027 .

<https://example.org/amltrix/link/095adac0-f163-457a-b8e4-fe14321bc04f> a amlo:ProductServiceLink ;
    dct:description """- By routing traffic through multiple VPN servers, criminals obscure their real geographical origin, undermining geolocation-based risk assessments.  
- Rapid switching between VPN nodes creates transaction trails across unrelated jurisdictions, complicating AML monitoring and investigations."""@en ;
    amlo:productService amx:PS0131 ;
