<https://example.org/amltrix/link/095ee0c1-b748-4354-a503-f84ef78479d5> a amlo:ProductServiceLink ;
    dct:description """- Allows fraudsters to pose as legitimate businesses to secure and receive government relief funds under falsified eligibility claims.  
