<https://example.org/amltrix/link/09743e64-7def-4595-8bad-732a291dd2b8> a amlo:MitigationLink ;
    dct:description "Continuously monitor the local entity’s business performance and usage of foreign capital to ensure that the inflows align with legitimate growth or project milestones. Investigate instances where repeated large injections lack corroborating operational expansion, and report such discrepancies to relevant teams for further risk assessment and potential action."@en ;
    amlo:mitigation amx:M0024 ;
