    dct:description "Provide specialized training for frontline and investigative teams to spot patterns unique to mobile payment layering, such as multiple low-value cross-border transactions at abnormal frequencies. Emphasize the identification of stolen or falsified identities, device mismatches, and repeated use of the same device for different accounts."@en ;
