<https://example.org/amltrix/link/0a7fbae4-7d20-4606-8208-ad7c58f74652> a amlo:MitigationLink ;
    dct:description "Establish partnerships with other financial institutions, law enforcement, and industry consortia to exchange intelligence on known compromised identities, repeat impersonation patterns, and emerging document-forgery techniques. Leveraging collective data helps quickly flag accounts using stolen or fabricated documentation."@en ;
