<https://example.org/amltrix/link/0d85932a-e888-44b0-b58e-1fa6ec529997> a amlo:InstrumentLink ;
    dct:description """- Criminals present falsified or manipulated shipping documents (e.g., bills of lading) to obtain letters of credit for over- or under-invoiced oil/fuel shipments.
