<https://example.org/amltrix/link/0dc0d22c-f675-4739-b2a0-d1440e465bbf> a amlo:ActorLink ;
    dct:description """Criminals use cryptocurrency exchanges to:

- Convert illicit fiat into payment tokens under weak KYC controls.
