<https://example.org/amltrix/link/0e06ebd2-1b51-47ed-adc8-025652e37ea7> a amlo:RiskLink ;
    dct:description "Carousel fraud exploits cross-border differences in VAT rules and inconsistent tax enforcement across multiple countries. Criminals repeatedly import and export goods or services through various jurisdictions, taking advantage of regulatory gaps and weak coordination among tax authorities. This allows them to claim illegitimate VAT refunds while obscuring the circular nature of transactions."@en ;
