<https://example.org/amltrix/link/0e2cae3c-11b3-43e8-8109-d15a89a8d126> a amlo:ProductServiceLink ;
    dct:description """- Enables large, negotiated trades with reduced public visibility, allowing colluding counterparties to conduct repeated round-trip transactions off-exchange.  
