<https://example.org/amltrix/link/10c4412a-06a6-484e-b846-de43b0dbac59> a amlo:InstrumentLink ;
    dct:description """- Traffickers open or control multiple bank accounts, sometimes using fraudulent identification documents or shell entities, to deposit and move illicit proceeds.
