    amlo:technique amx:T0051 .

<https://example.org/amltrix/link/120537cf-cb3b-4424-ba59-aa743c33904c> a amlo:ProductServiceLink ;
    dct:description """- Criminals exploit trade finance instruments to over- or under-invoice commodities, obscuring the true value of goods.  
