<https://example.org/amltrix/link/125cd6d4-766e-4659-bff9-743e63419e12> a amlo:InstrumentLink ;
    dct:description """- Criminals deliberately overfund single-premium or investment-linked policies with illicit cash, disguising these contributions as normal premium payments.
