<https://example.org/amltrix/link/26e9ed17-ea5b-4fed-9bd7-f4a4dac7fcab> a amlo:InstrumentLink ;
    dct:description """- Fraudsters direct fraudulent unemployment deposits into personal checking accounts opened under falsified credentials.
- Because these benefit payments appear to originate from a legitimate government source, they often face minimal investigation by financial institutions.
