<https://example.org/amltrix/link/26febb3c-656e-4ca6-99a8-3a55bec9236d> a amlo:MitigationLink ;
    dct:description "Implement rigorous expense reimbursement controls requiring itemized receipts, mandatory managerial approvals above specific cost thresholds, and standardized expense forms. Schedule random spot checks and enforce dual sign-off for high-value claims. By ensuring each reimbursement is validated with complete documentation and oversight, institutions reduce opportunities for forged receipts and inflated expenses, directly targeting expense report fraud vulnerabilities."@en ;
    amlo:mitigation amx:M0009 ;
    amlo:technique amx:T0144.006 .

<https://example.org/amltrix/link/270aea68-1571-4d5f-bef6-030662651ef1> a amlo:ProductServiceLink ;
    dct:description """- Professionals in this field can falsify or mask transactional records to disguise illegal income as legitimate earnings.  
