<https://example.org/amltrix/link/2d8ccee7-428f-4d64-b4df-0db4dbc711f6> a amlo:InstrumentLink ;
    dct:description """- Offenders open or utilize existing personal or business bank accounts to deposit small sums of illicit cash, blending them with legitimate transactions.
- By structuring these deposits below typical monitoring thresholds, criminals avoid red flags, especially when the accounts are linked to cash-intensive businesses whose daily receipts often fluctuate.
- This practice hinders financial institutions’ ability to distinguish illicit funds from normal account activity."""@en ;
    amlo:instrument amx:IN0008 ;
    amlo:technique amx:T0146 .

<https://example.org/amltrix/link/2d93dde8-5bc7-41e4-b9ce-f84b4b2b2b6f> a amlo:ProductServiceLink ;
    dct:description """- Specialized cross-border trade support can be exploited to navigate customs and regulatory requirements while concealing illicit wildlife.  
