<https://example.org/amltrix/link/2e8693ef-2a09-4440-a5b6-e3b3568cd0fa> a amlo:InstrumentLink ;
    dct:description """- Criminals exploit intangible asset valuations (e.g., patents, trademarks, or royalty agreements), artificially inflating or undervaluing them to shift funds between entities.
