<https://example.org/amltrix/link/31404868-561a-4232-acf0-01c37875f7a1> a amlo:MitigationLink ;
    dct:description "Deploy specialized trade surveillance systems that flag abrupt or large-volume trades immediately preceding market-moving announcements and rapidly liquidated positions thereafter. These systems compare trade execution times against corporate disclosures, highlighting activity indicative of insider dealings and preventing criminals from covertly leveraging non-public information."@en ;
    amlo:mitigation amx:M0026 ;
    amlo:technique amx:T0136 .

<https://example.org/amltrix/link/3141b8b7-478e-4387-8e9e-eef6d3839c52> a amlo:DataSourceLink ;
    dct:description """- Documents the cross-border movement of goods, including declared values, shipping routes, and associated documentation.
