<https://example.org/amltrix/link/3144cc78-aabc-4283-b84f-2ceef5a6c217> a amlo:MitigationLink ;
    dct:description "Collect and verify payer information for each deposit to a financial product, confirming a legitimate relationship with the policyholder or account holder. Verify the source of funds when third-party contributions exceed standard requirements. This measure helps reveal unauthorized or suspicious overfunding attempts that may conceal illicit proceeds."@en ;
