<https://example.org/amltrix/link/31586480-0f3b-484a-8fd7-2f3d37b4b7bb> a amlo:ProductServiceLink ;
    dct:description """- Criminals can place near-simultaneous buy and sell orders for the same security using multiple accounts under their control, resulting in minimal net position changes while artificially inflating trading volume.  
