<https://example.org/amltrix/link/3b39041d-e6c1-48ca-a11f-5ee46b692d4a> a amlo:DataSourceLink ;
    dct:description """- Aggregates known or suspected fraudulent wallet addresses, flagged entities, and scam patterns.
