<https://example.org/amltrix/link/3d41993d-1c4f-4129-8e37-f919cd99f3d4> a amlo:InstrumentLink ;
    dct:description """- Offenders use currency forwards, options, or swaps to present an appearance of legitimate hedging strategies. 
