<https://example.org/amltrix/link/3d6532d5-c57c-44c3-9082-574ae24fc165> a amlo:ProductServiceLink ;
    dct:description """- Services that streamline cross-border transactions can be duped by false paperwork masking illegal wildlife or timber flows.  
