- Identify mismatches between declared risk profiles and high-volume or complex token swaps."""@en ;
    amlo:dataSource amx:DS0039 ;
    amlo:technique amx:T0067.003 .

<https://example.org/amltrix/link/48051186-27dc-4ff2-8a59-3f6ad54fed49> a amlo:DataSourceLink ;
    dct:description """- Collects publicly accessible information, such as social media, online forums, and web content.
