<https://example.org/amltrix/link/4bd747e7-3f1c-43f6-bd52-c69d3a728394> a amlo:MitigationLink ;
    dct:description "Conduct thorough due diligence on external loan brokers, outsourcing partners, or correspondent lenders assisting in loan origination. Verify their licensing, examine their AML procedures, and confirm they maintain robust KYC and EDD practices. By monitoring the integrity of third-party relationships, institutions block criminals from exploiting weaker intermediaries in loan-based laundering schemes."@en ;
