    amlo:technique amx:T0053 .

<https://example.org/amltrix/link/5de1b633-0c26-471b-a4f8-9372195dd3ea> a amlo:ProductServiceLink ;
    dct:description """- Offer the essential mechanism for transferring and receiving funds among deceptive corporate entities, enabling the circulation of illicit proceeds claimed from bogus VAT refunds. 
