    amlo:instrument amx:IN0051 ;
    amlo:technique amx:T0014.006 .

<https://example.org/amltrix/link/5e3ec323-4026-46e8-99e5-40fa95210812> a amlo:ProductServiceLink ;
    dct:description """- Criminals deliberately overpay a credit card account to create a large positive balance.  
- They then request a refund or withdrawal of the surplus, receiving seemingly legitimate payouts from the card issuer.  
