<https://example.org/amltrix/link/673df783-917a-4153-96a0-1819189972e4> a amlo:ProductServiceLink ;
    dct:description """- Criminals engage in trades directly with counterparties, often with minimal identity verification, merging illicit funds with legitimate user activity. 
- The direct user-to-user model conceals the original source of funds, making it difficult to isolate tainted transactions."""@en ;
    amlo:productService amx:PS0011 ;
