<https://example.org/amltrix/link/67442bf1-cefa-411a-8093-8eedc40059e0> a amlo:ProductServiceLink ;
    dct:description """- Deposit counterfeit product revenues as legitimate business income, commingling illicit proceeds with legitimate funds. 
