    dct:description "Self-hosted wallets give criminals direct custody of illicit funds outside regulated platforms, allowing them to bypass centralized KYC and freezing measures. This impedes investigators' ability to trace or halt transactions. The primary objective is to ensure minimal external oversight and maximize anonymity for illicit proceeds."@en ;
