<https://example.org/amltrix/link/6a2801bf-c0be-4b20-9d3a-cbcec2cefd7c> a amlo:ProductServiceLink ;
    dct:description """- Facilitates the formation and maintenance of nominal or shell companies used to issue or receive overbilled service invoices.  
