    amlo:actor amx:AT0052 ;
    amlo:technique amx:T0130.001 .

<https://example.org/amltrix/link/6a99fde4-941d-4a93-814b-3f974de99ce1> a amlo:InstrumentLink ;
    dct:description """- Criminals exploit utility tokens on decentralized platforms to conduct multiple cross-asset swaps, layering illicit funds with minimal regulatory oversight.
- By rapidly exchanging tokens in different DeFi ecosystems, offenders create complex transaction paths, making it extremely difficult for investigators to follow.
