<https://example.org/amltrix/link/6aa16939-8284-4830-924f-a77f3e2762a2> a amlo:ProductServiceLink ;
    dct:description """- Fraudsters manipulate remote onboarding by submitting altered or stolen identification records, bypassing limited or automated ID checks. 
