<https://example.org/amltrix/link/6adf1010-1a55-41bd-ad48-cf71a62da7bd> a amlo:MitigationLink ;
    dct:description "Deliver targeted training to teach frontline teams how to identify red flags in the appraisal process for art, jewelry, real estate, and luxury goods. Emphasize the heightened scrutiny needed when asset valuations deviate sharply from known benchmarks or rely on obscure, unverifiable appraisers. Instruct staff on escalating anomalies for in-depth review."@en ;
