    amlo:technique amx:T0074.001 .

<https://example.org/amltrix/link/6afcc955-96c1-47cf-9816-e0e6b75bf886> a amlo:InstrumentLink ;
    dct:description """- Fraudsters set up bank accounts (personal or business) using stolen or fabricated identification to deposit worthless checks.
