    amlo:technique amx:T0067.001 .

<https://example.org/amltrix/link/6c9abe93-faa7-454f-9da0-163ed5562809> a amlo:ProductServiceLink ;
    dct:description """- Facilitate direct user-to-user trades where counterparties can be controlled by the same individuals, enabling matched buy/sell orders.  
