    amlo:actor amx:AT0008 ;
    amlo:technique amx:T0014.005 .

<https://example.org/amltrix/link/6d5c590b-e54f-45ca-847f-81d3cd6f8acc> a amlo:ProductServiceLink ;
    dct:description """- Mules can deposit or withdraw illicit cash with minimal identification, exploiting weak or non-existent AML controls.
- Large or repeated deposits and withdrawals facilitate layering, obscuring the true origin and flow of funds.
