<https://example.org/amltrix/link/6d9104cf-7cae-4edf-a524-ca177feaa9d9> a amlo:DataSourceLink ;
    dct:description """- Contain verified customer identities, beneficial ownership information, documented source of funds, and historical changes to customer risk profiles.
