<https://example.org/amltrix/link/77b7f728-f8db-492a-a500-6d83f85180d6> a amlo:ProductServiceLink ;
    dct:description """- This service is central for preparing commercial invoices, bills of lading, and other paperwork that criminals may falsify to misrepresent goods or values.  
