    amlo:technique amx:T0008 .

<https://example.org/amltrix/link/7a15062d-1319-4a66-9641-abe66fad01e2> a amlo:ActorLink ;
    dct:description """Money mules enable layering by:

- Opening accounts at regulated exchanges—whether knowingly or under false pretenses—on behalf of illicit operators.
