<https://example.org/amltrix/link/7a20eeca-9dca-453e-bf20-b0a11c418c21> a amlo:ProductServiceLink ;
    dct:description """- Enables submission of inflated or fabricated invoices tied to rigged contracts, presenting illicit gains as normal procurement expenses.  
