<https://example.org/amltrix/link/7a5bb7ae-6257-4d84-9441-0c950e671765> a amlo:ProductServiceLink ;
    dct:description """- In cross-border scenarios, multiple respondent banks process fragments of transactions, with each seeing only localized account and transfer information.  
