<https://example.org/amltrix/link/7a5e0a35-45c4-4119-b65d-102b646a64a5> a amlo:ActorLink ;
    dct:description """Shelf companies frequently include nominee directors or employees who:

- Appear in official filings but do not exercise genuine control.
