<https://example.org/amltrix/link/7a766e12-6b07-4c39-9817-942cf6e7fc22> a amlo:ProductServiceLink ;
    dct:description """- Intermediary banks in cross-border transactions may fail to detect inflated invoice values, enabling seamless movement of overvalued export proceeds.  
