<https://example.org/amltrix/link/7ae8ad96-cc43-4915-b59c-9bc249ed70a2> a amlo:MitigationLink ;
    dct:description "Apply deeper scrutiny to accounts or customers where financial flows, social media footprints, or referral patterns suggest potential money mule involvement. Require documented proof of legitimate income sources, conduct additional ID checks, and obtain management approval before permitting high-volume or cross-border transfers."@en ;
