<https://example.org/amltrix/link/7af72624-89d7-4341-8c6c-572a7724ffd2> a amlo:ProductServiceLink ;
    dct:description """- Criminals submit falsified or incomplete bills of lading under D/P or D/A arrangements, concealing the true nature or value of goods.  
