    amlo:tactic amx:ML.TA0007 ;
    amlo:technique amx:T0011 .

<https://example.org/amltrix/link/7d85e8b8-6560-464c-9db0-e679caa98451> a amlo:DataSourceLink ;
    dct:description """- Provides official or aggregated details of an entity's registration, ownership structures, shareholders, directors, and beneficial owners.
