<https://example.org/amltrix/link/7d8e36f0-c6a8-4913-b801-49d9296e1977> a amlo:InstrumentLink ;
    dct:description """- Forged shipping and export documents (e.g., bills of lading) are submitted to trigger payments under letters of credit.
