<https://example.org/amltrix/link/7dcf8322-4ce3-4bdb-91ff-b94881e55b96> a amlo:DataSourceLink ;
    dct:description """- Identifies foreign jurisdictions with weak AML controls or enforcement and highlights cross-border operational risks.
