<https://example.org/amltrix/link/7ece68b4-ef45-4a07-898d-80e5ef377af6> a amlo:InstrumentLink ;
    dct:description """- Shell companies in certain jurisdictions issue bearer shares, meaning ownership depends solely on the physical possession of share certificates.
