<https://example.org/amltrix/link/7f4f0fa8-9123-481f-8111-ddc0be305cf8> a amlo:DataSourceLink ;
    dct:description """- Includes shipping manifests, bills of lading, invoices, and certificates of origin for cross-border transactions.
