<https://example.org/amltrix/link/84284e38-0555-4078-9094-2289f38d48a4> a amlo:DataSourceLink ;
    dct:description """Official or aggregated records detailing corporate structures, shareholders, and beneficial owners.

- Identifies shell or front companies used to purchase properties at auction and obscure ultimate ownership.
