<https://example.org/amltrix/link/8ca96df7-0a64-4c8c-857f-bb8692855575> a amlo:ProductServiceLink ;
    dct:description """- Ephemeral shell companies open business accounts for rapid deposits and withdrawals tied to fraudulent invoices or other illicit transactions.  
