<https://example.org/amltrix/link/8dabdd07-2e35-4758-b89f-078068b24b42> a amlo:InstrumentLink ;
    dct:description """- Criminals purchase high-value jewelry, often composed of precious metals and gemstones, using illicit funds outside standard financial channels.  
