<https://example.org/amltrix/link/8db202bc-ef36-4462-b5c4-7974503ff5a0> a amlo:MitigationLink ;
    dct:description "Use maritime databases, port registries, and other external resources to confirm actual shipping routes, cargo details, and counterparties. Cross-reference vessel tracking data with declared shipping manifests to detect inconsistencies, such as unexpected transshipment points or falsified documents. This tactic counters trade diversion by revealing deviations from declared shipping itineraries that conceal the true origin or recipient of the goods."@en ;
    amlo:mitigation amx:M0021 ;
    amlo:technique amx:T0030 .

