<https://example.org/amltrix/link/8dd90cc1-adb9-465e-a56d-d817104a3ef5> a amlo:RiskLink ;
    dct:description "Criminals exploit the subjective valuation, portability, and ease of re-exporting of diamonds as core vulnerabilities. By falsifying import documents, repeatedly inflating declared diamond values, and rotating the same parcels across borders, they obscure the true transaction amounts and origins. The opaque pricing inherent to diamonds enables continuous layering within trade finance and banking channels."@en ;
