<https://example.org/amltrix/link/904de092-ae9d-46a7-9823-f98680e87cfd> a amlo:MitigationLink ;
    dct:description "Provide specialized training on the hallmarks of self-hosted and privacy wallets, including red flags such as instant coin conversions, stealth addresses, or chain-hopping. Teach staff to spot unusual wallet usage patterns and rapidly escalate suspicious activity for deeper analysis, ensuring front-line awareness of non-custodial wallet risks."@en ;
    amlo:mitigation amx:M0013 ;
    amlo:technique amx:T0034 .

<https://example.org/amltrix/link/9050f01f-bcd8-43e4-939a-459c26a594fd> a amlo:DataSourceLink ;
