<https://example.org/amltrix/link/90ba1e12-ca39-48dd-9ec5-9d72e7b16eac> a amlo:ActorLink ;
    dct:description "Illicit operators open mobile payment accounts under fabricated or stolen identities, conducting frequent, small-value transfers that fragment the transaction chain. By layering funds across multiple digital wallets or P2P services, they obscure the illicit origin of the money. This practice complicates customer due diligence and transaction monitoring for financial institutions, as the fragmented transactions are harder to link back to a single criminal source."@en ;
    amlo:actor amx:AT0052 ;
    amlo:technique amx:T0134.002 .

