<https://example.org/amltrix/link/90c7bb29-57ae-4e40-9969-f803f3d673a7> a amlo:MitigationLink ;
    dct:description "Implement automated systems to correlate cage and table activity across multiple patrons, identifying convergent chip redemptions from numerous small buy-ins. Flag quick, repeated visits by groups and aggregate their betting volumes to detect anomalous patterns indicative of collusion or minimal play consistent with mule-based throughput of illicit funds."@en ;
    amlo:mitigation amx:M0004 ;
