<https://example.org/amltrix/link/99d25cbb-6da7-4b10-a2c5-de4778c9a2c6> a amlo:InstrumentLink ;
    dct:description """- Enhanced privacy features such as ring signatures and stealth addresses obscure transaction details.
- Criminals leverage P2P trades of privacy coins to conceal beneficial ownership, bypassing formal identity checks.
