<https://example.org/amltrix/link/9a52f2a1-0075-4a69-8e26-ec803e00fb68> a amlo:ProductServiceLink ;
    dct:description """- Criminals may create multiple exchange accounts under different identities and trade the same digital assets among these accounts, artificially inflating volume and obscuring the true origins of funds.  
