    dct:description "The technique exploits intangible consulting services, which are easily fabricated and difficult to corroborate, to mask illicit payments as legitimate advisory fees. Unlike customer identity issues, this additional vulnerability arises from the inherent nature of professional consultancy services, which require minimal documentation and can obfuscate the true purposes of transactions."@en ;
    amlo:riskType amx:RS0002 ;
