<https://example.org/amltrix/link/9b0962c4-6d4c-4568-8e71-373c7663c0c4> a amlo:ActorLink ;
    dct:description """Payment service providers connect merchants to payment networks and handle transaction settlements. Criminals exploit these providers by:

