<https://example.org/amltrix/link/9d2b1a1f-2898-475b-9993-b3c5e5815d02> a amlo:ActorLink ;
    dct:description """These minimally active entities are used to obscure beneficial ownership and route revenues from counterfeit goods as though they stem from legitimate operations.

