<https://example.org/amltrix/link/9d2ed737-95a3-497d-9f96-4e4608f042b7> a amlo:ProductServiceLink ;
    dct:description """- Loyalty points can function similarly to stored value instruments, enabling minimal AML scrutiny when loading illicit funds.  
