<https://example.org/amltrix/link/9f415083-26d1-491e-b122-88d592c18ece> a amlo:DataSourceLink ;
    dct:description """- Provides detailed records of financial transactions, including timestamps, amounts, accounts, and parties involved.
- Enables identification of patterns such as large or frequent purchases of luxury goods or precious metals beyond a customer’s typical financial behavior, supporting detection of potential laundering through high-value asset conversions."""@en ;
    amlo:dataSource amx:DS0019 ;
    amlo:technique amx:T0007 .

<https://example.org/amltrix/link/9f482fed-4d9e-4e56-bc9f-25a32042f038> a amlo:DataSourceLink ;
