<https://example.org/amltrix/link/9f4f411a-3edb-4eca-9ab0-bf8850497fd0> a amlo:MitigationLink ;
    dct:description "Identify jurisdictions that are still issuing or heavily using large-value banknotes and rate them as higher risk. Apply enhanced controls, such as Enhanced Due Diligence (EDD) and stricter service restrictions, to transactions or customers connected with these regions. This approach reduces the likelihood of undetected bulk cash transport across borders."@en ;
    amlo:mitigation amx:M0001 ;
    amlo:technique amx:T0065.002 .

<https://example.org/amltrix/link/9f624c51-a011-4792-9dcc-1790b44f102c> a amlo:ProductServiceLink ;
    dct:description """- Enables immediate swapping of cryptojacked assets into different tokens, making it harder to trace original sources. 
- Quick, often non-custodial services leave limited time for compliance checks, accelerating laundering activities."""@en ;
    amlo:productService amx:PS0023 ;
    amlo:technique amx:T0020.002 .

<https://example.org/amltrix/link/9f6c3c9c-be8d-4e63-98fb-ff0f8f6611a2> a amlo:DataSourceLink ;
    dct:description """- Contains balance sheets, profit-and-loss statements, tax filings, and related financial documentation for property management or real estate entities.  

- Enables cross-verification of declared operational income, rental revenue, and reported expenses against actual transaction flows, identifying discrepancies or inflated figures that suggest commingling."""@en ;
    amlo:dataSource amx:DS0007 ;
    amlo:technique amx:T0010.002 .

<https://example.org/amltrix/link/9f6ef9e6-c4fa-4f56-8122-2d19aef13acd> a amlo:DataSourceLink ;
    dct:description "Encompasses shipping logs, bills of lading, and certificates of origin used to validate cross-border shipments. Investigators compare trade-related documents to internal invoices or statements to uncover forged entries or inconsistent details in manipulated records."@en ;
