<https://example.org/amltrix/link/a2c0fca5-7641-4870-830a-d86f763dec59> a amlo:ProductServiceLink ;
    dct:description """- Shell companies open offshore accounts to deposit or transfer illicit proceeds with reduced transparency obligations.  
