<https://example.org/amltrix/link/a2d0794b-ae1d-4e2b-846d-078e65cf8434> a amlo:ActorLink ;
    dct:description """Virtual asset users employ micro-structuring by:

- Splitting illicit funds into numerous small digital asset transfers, often below exchange or wallet alert thresholds.
