<https://example.org/amltrix/link/a2d8b21b-1c47-4702-b33b-93a06630ae6e> a amlo:InstrumentLink ;
    dct:description """- Documentary instruments (e.g., bills of lading, shipping documents) are used to legitimize artificially altered invoice values.
