    dct:description "Conduct rigorous due diligence on brokers, custodians, and other financial intermediaries involved in share-lending or short-selling transactions. Evaluate their controls for tracking beneficial ownership through dividend dates, and restrict or terminate relationships if they allow or overlook multiple fraudulent tax reclaim filings."@en ;
