<https://example.org/amltrix/link/a3251572-9552-4c68-ba2c-5f019a598108> a amlo:ActorLink ;
    dct:description """Cybercriminals exploit software vulnerabilities or deploy malicious tools to:

- Inject false transaction data and override audit logs.
