<https://example.org/amltrix/link/a34c2898-adc4-4682-87a5-1c2e015b25ed> a amlo:ActorLink ;
    dct:description """Criminals leverage VASPs, often unwittingly, to facilitate governance token obfuscation by:

- Taking advantage of minimal or no-KYC onboarding and decentralized trading venues to transact governance tokens without easily traceable identities.
