<https://example.org/amltrix/link/a3619d69-5508-488c-9d3a-ba1fde2b9c7f> a amlo:InstrumentLink ;
    dct:description """- Government relief funds, such as unemployment benefits, are often loaded onto prepaid or stored-value cards, which typically require minimal documentation.
