<https://example.org/amltrix/link/ad47f238-40af-4855-8a93-d4c15a8c093f> a amlo:MitigationLink ;
    dct:description "Require newly formed or high-volume e-commerce merchants to provide verifiable business documentation, domain registration details, and shipping or fulfillment records. Confirm that products offered match actual inventory and correlate with the merchant’s stated line of business to prevent sham storefronts and inflated sales."@en ;
    amlo:mitigation amx:M0003 ;
    amlo:technique amx:T0028 .

<https://example.org/amltrix/link/ad498959-8595-443d-9b61-a8e3e3e5eedf> a amlo:DataSourceLink ;
    dct:description """- Provides detailed information on cross-border financial transfers, including involved institutions, sending/receiving jurisdictions, and transaction amounts.
