    amlo:productService amx:PS0072 ;
    amlo:technique amx:T0069.002 .

<https://example.org/amltrix/link/ae7cb752-6b6e-4e34-b346-6e808a912ab1> a amlo:ProductServiceLink ;
    dct:description """- Illicit actors may inject or modify payment data mid-process, creating false transaction logs or receipts to hide the true flow of illicit funds.  
