<https://example.org/amltrix/link/b0436332-9604-4157-9db6-65ef4fd7cba8> a amlo:ProductServiceLink ;
    dct:description """- Facilitate fictitious or inflated payroll records, disguising illegal proceeds as wages for coerced labor.  
