    amlo:dataSource amx:DS0039 ;
    amlo:technique amx:T0016 .

<https://example.org/amltrix/link/b087b613-bb33-478c-8d87-424dbbdb60c2> a amlo:DataSourceLink ;
    dct:description """- Provides trade details such as asset types, trading pairs, executed volumes, timestamps, counterparties, and price data, enabling the detection of frequent cross-asset conversions from or to self-hosted wallet addresses.
