    amlo:dataSource amx:DS0046 ;
    amlo:technique amx:T0034 .

<https://example.org/amltrix/link/b0b5e05c-1fab-44ff-9d11-b5a9206b98b2> a amlo:InstrumentLink ;
    dct:description """- Fraudsters overstate export values or submit forged trade documents, such as bills of lading and pro forma invoices, to claim inflated tax rebates.
- The complexity of cross-border trade finance procedures masks these contrived transactions, making it difficult for tax authorities to detect that no genuine export took place.
