    amlo:technique amx:T0036 .

<https://example.org/amltrix/link/b0c511e0-e828-43b3-90fa-b8fb7c47aef8> a amlo:ProductServiceLink ;
    dct:description """- Enables quick deposit and withdrawal channels for gambling platforms, providing a ready avenue for funneling illicit proceeds.  
- Stolen or compromised payment credentials can fund gambling accounts, where transactions appear as legitimate betting activity until withdrawn as legitimate “winnings.”  
