    dct:description "Implement targeted transaction monitoring aligned with agricultural cycles and known cost structures. Flag large or repeated cash deposits that deviate from typical seasonal revenue benchmarks. Additionally, monitor cross-border transfers involving agricultural goods from or to high-risk jurisdictions, exposing potential layering of illicit funds through disguised commodity-related transactions."@en ;
    amlo:mitigation amx:M0004 ;
    amlo:technique amx:T0014.004 .

<https://example.org/amltrix/link/b160b672-b412-4823-a516-b63daea0ca3a> a amlo:ProductServiceLink ;
