<https://example.org/amltrix/link/b4a24717-ba57-4559-88f1-c311608b24c0> a amlo:ProductServiceLink ;
    dct:description """- Once illicit cash is successfully transported across borders, criminals deposit it into offshore accounts to obscure its origin.  
