<https://example.org/amltrix/link/b4a27e2e-92c9-4b20-b70c-3a66a2cb6047> a amlo:ProductServiceLink ;
    dct:description """- Criminals may rely on compliant or unwitting accountants to layer funds by creating elaborate paper trails.  
