    amlo:dataSource amx:DS0023 ;
    amlo:technique amx:T0051.001 .

<https://example.org/amltrix/link/b4d57ba7-be70-4c27-abfe-e140590b627a> a amlo:InstrumentLink ;
    dct:description """- Criminals directly convert illicit funds into gold or gemstones, exploiting minimal regulatory oversight in certain jurisdictions.
- High global demand and portability allow easy resale or cross-border transport, concealing the source of funds through repeated buy-sell cycles.
