<https://example.org/amltrix/link/b4d8d77d-baa4-4dfe-a024-19647d7bbee1> a amlo:RiskLink ;
    dct:description "Criminals exploit weak environmental regulations and corrupt local authorities in certain regions to conduct illegal logging on a large scale. They also move timber and proceeds across multiple jurisdictions with varying AML enforcement, complicating oversight. This creates a central vulnerability that enables ongoing illicit activity and money laundering."@en ;
