    amlo:technique amx:T0085 .

<https://example.org/amltrix/link/b578db7f-ff80-4396-833b-f3340d642210> a amlo:DataSourceLink ;
    dct:description """- Contains verified identities, beneficial ownership details, and risk assessments of customers and related parties.
