<https://example.org/amltrix/link/b5db5009-b179-4877-98a3-8c1f7bf843e7> a amlo:ActorLink ;
    dct:description """Terrorist organizations rely on arms trafficking to:

- Secure weaponry for operational purposes, smuggling firearms and related materials across borders.
