<https://example.org/amltrix/link/ba18b774-11cc-4ffc-91b1-abfb364cb049> a amlo:ProductServiceLink ;
    dct:description """- Criminals establish front or shell companies in sectors such as logging or fishing, then open business bank accounts to deposit illicit proceeds from illegal resource extraction.  
