<https://example.org/amltrix/link/ba2eaf89-264e-4bbb-9fc9-529fa3477b92> a amlo:DataSourceLink ;
    dct:description """Includes official shipping documents (e.g., bills of lading, invoices, certificates of origin) used in cross-border trade. 

