    amlo:technique amx:T0146 .

<https://example.org/amltrix/link/ba32216c-1d5f-4212-9ca3-0c649dd5ea25> a amlo:RiskLink ;
    dct:description "Criminals exploit cross-border vulnerabilities by moving diamonds through jurisdictions with weak customs controls or poor AML oversight. They forge or omit Kimberley Process Certificates, misdeclare shipments, and route diamonds through free trade zones or trans-shipment points with lax enforcement. These actions obscure the true origin and destination of the gems, making it difficult for authorities or financial institutions to link proceeds back to their illicit source."@en ;
