    amlo:dataSource amx:DS0005 ;
    amlo:technique amx:T0024.001 .

<https://example.org/amltrix/link/ba504540-d077-478a-94a0-0cd06e1eaa7a> a amlo:ActorLink ;
    dct:description """Cybercriminals exploit metaverse platforms to launder illicit cryptocurrency by:

- Swapping stolen tokens on decentralized exchanges to evade detection.
- Purchasing digital assets (e.g., virtual real estate or NFTs) in the metaverse to layer funds through complex transaction chains.
- Rapidly reselling these assets to unwitting buyers, receiving new tokens or fiat that appear detached from the original illicit source.

This process challenges financial institutions’ ability to trace and link transactions back to the underlying crime."""@en ;
    amlo:actor amx:AT0014 ;
    amlo:technique amx:T0066.001 .

<https://example.org/amltrix/link/ba553fd3-cfc6-4d82-b6ab-4bbbc79112b4> a amlo:DataSourceLink ;
