<https://example.org/amltrix/link/bac19797-28b9-4e17-b165-c6d040587145> a amlo:ProductServiceLink ;
    dct:description """- Criminals exploit decentralized exchanges and lending protocols within DeFi ecosystems to swap stolen tokens, bypassing controls that might flag or freeze suspicious funds.  
