<https://example.org/amltrix/link/c02f656c-4512-4ae3-8195-7602bdb6e4b2> a amlo:MitigationLink ;
    dct:description "Temporarily suspend or limit certain high-risk services (e.g., large outgoing wires) if activity is identified from known VPN endpoints without legitimate justification. Require the customer to confirm their true location or business purpose before reactivating full privileges. By restricting potentially high-impact transactions initiated through concealed IP addresses, the institution disrupts adversaries' layering and anonymization strategies."@en ;
    amlo:mitigation amx:M0023 ;
    amlo:technique amx:T0015.001 .

