<https://example.org/amltrix/link/ca5213f6-3c96-4a67-909d-e656d239b7cc> a amlo:ProductServiceLink ;
    dct:description """- Allow criminals to enter matched positions or mirrored derivative contracts, producing artificially high trading volumes without true market exposure.  
