<https://example.org/amltrix/link/ce08719f-e9b9-4370-bca8-6dfd7312ae20> a amlo:ProductServiceLink ;
    dct:description """- By integrating mobile and web-based payment channels, criminals execute numerous micro-transactions or refunds, complicating any transactional review.  
