<https://example.org/amltrix/link/ce0ec658-f44f-432c-80c3-d13b44f3c8e0> a amlo:InstrumentLink ;
    dct:description """- Criminals establish or use existing shell companies as the official bidders in real estate auctions, concealing the true beneficial owners behind corporate layers.
