<https://example.org/amltrix/link/ce4a82c6-4d35-44e9-b1e6-42894541e775> a amlo:ProductServiceLink ;
    dct:description """- Illicit funds are routed among multiple personal or external wallets, creating complex transaction chains that hinder law enforcement’s ability to identify the end owner.  
