<https://example.org/amltrix/link/ce84ea10-1874-4c69-88f9-e1ccba59c903> a amlo:InstrumentLink ;
    dct:description """- Fraudsters submit fraudulent bills of lading and shipping records as proof of goods shipped under a letter of credit.
