- Facilitate the integration of illicit product revenue by making financial flows appear compliant with official documentation."""@en ;
    amlo:actor amx:AT0063 ;
    amlo:technique amx:T0143.001 .

<https://example.org/amltrix/link/dc0b5c7f-945f-4546-850c-8757a3e8242b> a amlo:DataSourceLink ;
    dct:description """- Includes verified identities, addresses, beneficial ownership data, and customer risk metrics.
