<https://example.org/amltrix/link/dc4f74c5-6d84-4c1e-afb9-c24120364c94> a amlo:ProductServiceLink ;
    dct:description """- Criminals turn illicit proceeds into gold items and quickly convert them back to cash via these services with minimal documentation.  
