<https://example.org/amltrix/link/dc6abc99-8b49-4935-9c3b-3aa500c829fc> a amlo:ProductServiceLink ;
    dct:description """- Mule recruiters instruct recruits to send or receive funds through remittance channels, often targeting cross-border corridors where institutional oversight can be challenging.  
