<https://example.org/amltrix/link/dc6c473d-e0ca-40e2-b092-4ee8404230cc> a amlo:InstrumentLink ;
    dct:description """- In the 'Crypto ATM Mule' variant, mules convert physical cash into cryptocurrency (or vice versa), obscuring the transaction chain.
