    amlo:dataSource amx:DS0049 ;
    amlo:technique amx:T0118 .

<https://example.org/amltrix/link/e36af6b3-e2b0-4fdb-b4b8-153b837fe841> a amlo:ActorLink ;
    dct:description """Wildlife traffickers generate illicit proceeds by illegally capturing, transporting, and selling protected species or their derivatives. They:

- Create or leverage complex arrangements (e.g., front entities or fraudulent invoices) to deposit and move funds, obscuring transaction origins.
- Exploit financial channels in multiple jurisdictions, making it difficult for financial institutions to trace or flag illegal proceeds."""@en ;
    amlo:actor amx:AT0018 ;
    amlo:technique amx:T0145.002 .

<https://example.org/amltrix/link/e3771820-5626-4c84-9381-896a8c4a5e22> a amlo:ProductServiceLink ;
    dct:description """- Criminals bring in fake banknotes to exchange for different currencies, exploiting gaps in verification.  
