    amlo:technique amx:T0011.001 .

<https://example.org/amltrix/link/f480cb18-58cc-41a5-972e-b33770e2ea90> a amlo:InstrumentLink ;
    dct:description """- Privacy-centric cryptocurrencies (e.g., Monero, Zcash) incorporate features such as stealth addresses, ring signatures, or zero-knowledge proofs that obscure transaction details.
- Sanctioned parties exploit these anonymity features to conceal the flow of value from blacklisted addresses or jurisdictions, preventing detection by compliance tools.
- This heightened privacy thwarts standard blockchain analytics, allowing undisclosed funds to move into or out of sanctioned regions."""@en ;
    amlo:instrument amx:IN0016 ;
