<https://example.org/amltrix/link/fb2e4d4e-5bef-4b05-8673-0e3fc023e6ac> a amlo:ProductServiceLink ;
    dct:description """- Criminals set up numerous pseudonymous or unhosted wallets to receive, hold, and redirect illicit proceeds.  
