    skos:definition "A comprehensive set of services facilitating the purchase, sale, exchange, and auction of artwork, antiquities, and historically significant items. These services, typically offered by specialized auction houses, galleries, and dealers, often include provenance research, authentication, private transactions, and organized auctions for collectors, museums, dealers, and investors."@en ;
