    skos:definition "Automated Teller Machine (ATM) services provide customers with the ability to perform banking transactions such as cash withdrawals, deposits, account inquiries, and fund transfers without needing to visit a bank branch. These services are available 24/7 and are offered by banks and financial institutions through electronic banking outlets at various locations."@en ;
