    amlo:shortDescription "Gambling operators are licensed entities offering betting services (e.g., casinos, betting shops, online platforms, or lotteries) that handle high-volume transactions and face elevated money laundering and terrorist financing risks. Consequently, they must implement stringent AML/CFT controls, including robust customer due diligence, transaction monitoring, and regulatory reporting to mitigate illicit financial flows."@en ;
    amlo:stixId "x-amltrix-actor--74fae302-e573-4de6-84b1-18f3c59975e9" .

