    amlo:shortDescription "Precious metals trading services enable individuals and institutions to buy, sell, and trade gold, silver, platinum, and palladium, commonly used as a hedge against market volatility. In an AML/CFT context, these high-value, easily transferable commodities can be exploited to disguise illicit funds and facilitate money laundering or terrorist financing."@en ;
    amlo:stixId "products-service--237c4d7e-3040-4b75-b257-3ecdecc5234d" .

