    amlo:shortDescription "Peer-to-Peer Exchange Operators are decentralized facilitators of direct digital asset transactions, often bypassing traditional financial intermediaries. This operational model introduces heightened AML/CFT vulnerabilities by potentially circumventing formal KYC/AML controls and enabling more anonymous trading environments."@en ;
    amlo:stixId "x-amltrix-actor--f501022c-65fc-47dc-bad9-fa0918b34a52" .

