    amlo:shortDescription "Legal professionals act as crucial gatekeepers in AML/CFT contexts by structuring transactions, conducting due diligence, and interfacing with financial institutions on behalf of clients. Their privileged position can be exploited to conceal or facilitate illicit financial activities, making strong compliance and oversight essential."@en ;
