    amlo:shortDescription "Dealers in precious metals, stones, or high-value goods facilitate large-value transactions and rely on specialized or negotiable pricing, creating opportunities for the concealment and movement of illicit funds. Their role in handling easily transportable assets with high, often opaque market value heightens their vulnerability to money laundering and terrorism financing activities."@en ;
