    amlo:shortDescription "Non-Fungible Tokens (NFTs) are unique, indivisible digital assets recorded on a blockchain, representing ownership of digital or physical items. While they secure provenance and facilitate trading of scarce digital items, NFTs can be misused for money laundering or terrorist financing by masking beneficial ownership and facilitating illicit transfers of value."@en ;
