    amlo:shortDescription "Online gambling accounts allow users to quickly deposit, wager, and withdraw funds, offering a potentially opaque channel for concealing the origin of illicit proceeds and facilitating money laundering through rapid and repeated transactions. These accounts’ online nature and ease of access can make detecting and tracing funds challenging for AML/CFT efforts."@en ;
