        amx:T0144.016,
        amx:T0144.018 ;
    amlo:shortDescription "Business entities, as legally separate structures with the capacity to hold assets, incur liabilities, and conduct transactions in their own names, can be exploited to conceal illicit funds or obscure ultimate beneficial ownership. Their broad commercial scope and legal autonomy make them an essential focus in adversarial threat modeling and AML/CFT risk assessments."@en ;
    amlo:stixId "x-amltrix-actor--2d4ca224-fffd-4348-9e14-abf88f62a309" .

