    skos:definition "A trade finance mechanism in which banks facilitate the collection of payments for goods in international trade. The exporter's bank forwards shipping and title documents to the importer's bank, which releases them only upon payment or acceptance of a draft, ensuring a structured and secure settlement process."@en ;
    skos:inScheme <https://example.org/amltrix/scheme/amltrix-ml> ;
