    skos:definition "Financial accounts held at banks or other financial institutions for depositing, withdrawing, and managing money. They serve as essential tools for day-to-day transactions, savings, and liquidity management. Specialized variations, such as concentration accounts or multi-currency accounts, offer additional functions like aggregating balances or holding funds in multiple currencies."@en ;
    skos:inScheme <https://example.org/amltrix/scheme/amltrix-ml> ;
    skos:notation "IN0008" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Bank Accounts"@en ;
